  "prefLabel": "Plc 1807.06 Challenging a Denial of Certification Renewal; Challenging Certification Conditions",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Plc 1807.06 Challenging a Denial of Certification Renewal; Challenging Certification Conditions. An applicant who wishes to challenge the denial of an application for certification renewal or who wishes to challenge conditions included in the certification shall do so as provided in Plc 308.12.\n\nSource. #14330, eff 9-22-25, EXPIRES: 9-22-35",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/plc1800.html"
